Z||000003||FieroGT||11-04-1999||05:05 PM||||It's called the "Fiero Online Service Guide", and it's been around for a few years. I accidentally discovered in back when I was in college and surfing the net. I've gotten a lot of good tips from this site. It used to be run by a guy who went by the alias "Sketch", but I don't know if he still has anything to do with it. I don't think it's been updated in a very long time. Still contains tons of info and worth reading through. I learned a lot from this site. Highly recommended reading, especially for newcomers to the World of Fieros. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||fiero56||11-04-1999||07:50 PM||||I was just on it the other day and saw a lot of stuff I don't remember being there, I'd say either he updated it, or someone else just got it, and is adding columns to it.  The ones I haden't seen before on it were the pw, pl, and pm adding columns.||||reg||1
